  "result": "Done! Added automatic tier-based discounts for customers:\n\n**Configuration:**\n- Exported `TIER_DISCOUNTS` from src/customers.js with default discounts: gold 5%, silver 2.5%, standard 0%\n\n**Behavior:**\n- `createInvoice` automatically applies the customer's tier discount to lines without an explicit `discountPercent`\n- A line's explicit `discountPercent` (even 0) always takes precedence over tier discount\n- Allows mixing: some lines with tier discounts, some with explicit overrides\n\n**Example:**\n```javascript\n// C-001 is gold tier (5% default)\ncreateInvoice({\n  customerId: 'C-001',\n  issueDate: '2025-10-15',\n  lines: [\n    { sku: 'DES-HOUR', qty: 10 },           // gets 5% tier discount\n    { sku: 'DEV-HOUR', qty: 5, discountPercent: 0 },   // explicit 0%, no discount\n    { sku: 'STICKER', qty: 100, discountPercent: 10 }  // explicit 10%\n  ]\n});\n```\n\n**Tests added:** 9 new tests covering tier application, override behavior, and calculations\n\n**Test results:** \u2705 All 92 tests pass (83 existing + 9 new)",
